      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier and my lower back just went crazy. like a sharp pop and now i have this weird shooting pain going all the way down my left leg. my foot feels kinda heavy too when i walk like it's not responding right. should i try some really deep stretches or maybe try to crack my back to get it back in place? i feel like i just need to loosen the tension",
