      "content": "urgent care is so expensive tho and i really dont want to wait weeks for an appointment. its prob just a muscle spasm or something right? i've done yoga for years so i know how to stretch properly. if i just do some intense hamstring stretches and maybe a few spinal twists it should help release the pressure, right? i dont want to make a big deal out of it if it's just a cramp.",
